brother-td-linux
================

This project is a derivative work based on:

  brother-td
  A command line script to print images to Brother TD label printers.
  https://github.com/scne59/brother-td
  Copyright (c) 2025 Jochen Schneider
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The original Perl utility provided the initial USB discovery, image
conversion, and Brother TD raster command sequence.  The CUPS filter, PPD
generation, media geometry, dithering, compression, PAPPL application, and
test suite in this repository are new work by the brother-td-linux
contributors.

